   "text": "I've sent you a password reset link. You approved the MFA push on your phone, which confirmed it's you.\n\n- **Where it went:** a text to the mobile number on your HR record, ending in **0138**.\n- **Time limit:** the link stops working after **30 minutes**, so use it soon.\n- **What to do:** open the link on your phone and set a new password. Then sign in to your laptop with it.\n\nYour account isn't locked, so you don't need to do anything else. I've marked ticket T-6010 as resolved. If the link doesn't arrive or doesn't work, message me here and I'll help."
