   "text": "Got it, thanks. The reset text just came through on this phone, I'm opening the link now. Quick check: the number ending 0138 is my mobile, so that's right."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Great, then you're all set. Once you've set the new password, your laptop might still be holding the old one, which can cause a sign-in error or two at first. If that happens:\n\n- Make sure the laptop is connected to the internet, either Wi-Fi or a cable.\n- Use the new password at the laptop's sign-in screen.\n- If it still won't take it, restart the laptop and try again.\n\nIf you're still stuck after that, message me here."
  },
